  "      ],",
  "      "description": "Deliberately thin. Anything here is the audit grading its own work, which no consumer can check, so it carries only what a reader can act on: paths they can open, and gaps stated in words. \`inventory\` covers the same ground verifiably, because a reader can grep the project against it.",",
  "      "properties": {",
